@startuml SEQ_10_MELIHAT_PERMOHONAN_PENGADAAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-10: Melihat Permohonan Pengadaan (View-Only)

actor       "Dosen / Asisten"          as Actor
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "InventarisController" as Controller
entity      "PermohonanAset Model"     as ModelPA

== Melihat Daftar Permohonan Pengadaan ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Buka menu Permohonan Pengadaan
Browser --> Actor : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/permohonan
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPA  : Query semua permohonan
ModelPA --> Controller : Data permohonan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman permohonan (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Daftar permohonan + tombol "Lihat Detail" saja

== Melihat Detail Permohonan ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Klik "Lihat Detail" pada salah satu permohonan
Browser --> Actor : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/permohonan/{id}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPA  : Query detail permohonan
ModelPA --> Controller : Data permohonan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman detail permohonan (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Detail permohonan: pengaju, lab, item, status, alasan penolakan (jika ada)

@enduml